WEBVTT

00:00:06.680 --> 00:00:08.320
Oh!

00:00:08.320 --> 00:00:10.210
Oh!

00:00:10.210 --> 00:00:12.190
Woooow!

00:00:12.570 --> 00:00:16.190
Fear-chan! Look over here!

00:00:16.190 --> 00:00:17.030
Mm?

00:00:20.730 --> 00:00:24.210
Look at you! How adorable can you get?

00:00:24.210 --> 00:00:27.710
Your cuteness might just be
dangerous for the environment!

00:00:27.710 --> 00:00:29.550
We have to protect it!

00:00:29.550 --> 00:00:31.350
Come on! You can have this too!

00:00:30.910 --> 00:00:33.580
Looks like your cookies are working on her.

00:00:33.580 --> 00:00:35.010
That's it! That's it!

00:00:35.010 --> 00:00:37.430
I guess she won't like my dried squid, huh?

00:00:36.550 --> 00:00:37.430
Say "ah"!

00:00:37.840 --> 00:00:40.160
You can't actually feed her that.

00:00:40.440 --> 00:00:41.760
She's cute!

00:00:40.440 --> 00:00:42.310
That'd be stupid.

00:00:42.310 --> 00:00:46.210
You know, traveling is a lot more fun
when everybody's together.

00:00:46.210 --> 00:00:47.360
Yep.

00:00:47.360 --> 00:00:48.310
Together?

00:00:52.600 --> 00:00:56.820
She does look lonely, but we can't help the fact that we're in different classes.

00:00:56.820 --> 00:01:01.030
Hmph. We'll be in the same group when we get there anyways.

00:01:01.030 --> 00:01:03.660
I wish Kuroe were coming with us instead of her.

00:01:03.660 --> 00:01:06.050
It would've been more fun with her here.

00:01:06.050 --> 00:01:09.540
It's not like she had a choice. This is a school activity.

00:01:17.820 --> 00:01:20.470
Although, I do feel bad about leaving Kuroe to do the house-sitting.

00:01:20.980 --> 00:01:26.260
I just know that our field trip's going to amazing!

00:01:26.260 --> 00:01:28.350
Hey, get back in! That's dangerous!

00:01:27.410 --> 00:01:29.600
No need to worry!

00:01:28.430 --> 00:01:29.600
Hey!

00:03:03.950 --> 00:03:05.950
Chapter   13

00:03:03.950 --> 00:03:05.950
｢The Outdoor School Confusion!｣

00:03:07.020 --> 00:03:08.040
Hello!

00:03:08.040 --> 00:03:09.540
Hi!

00:03:11.410 --> 00:03:13.540
W-Why are you two here?

00:03:12.890 --> 00:03:19.820
Chapter Eleven

00:03:12.890 --> 00:03:19.820
『 The fanatic is somewhere 』

00:03:13.540 --> 00:03:16.670
The board chairman is employing us part-time.

00:03:16.670 --> 00:03:19.800
Sove-chan and I handle the various
odds and ends around here.

00:03:23.590 --> 00:03:27.830
Well, this will only make the field trip even more fun.

00:03:27.830 --> 00:03:29.070
I'm glad you're here.

00:03:29.070 --> 00:03:31.560
Unfortunately, I'm afraid fun isn't the only thing on your schedule today.

00:03:32.940 --> 00:03:33.940
Yachi-sama!

00:03:35.100 --> 00:03:37.070
Could I speak to you for a bit?

00:03:40.440 --> 00:03:41.310
Yo!

00:03:41.310 --> 00:03:42.960
How do you do?

00:03:42.960 --> 00:03:43.570
It's me again.

00:03:43.570 --> 00:03:46.080
I have something I'd like you to do.

00:03:46.080 --> 00:03:48.080
Why is he bothering us when we're all the way out here?

00:03:48.080 --> 00:03:51.330
New orders? I have a bad feeling about this.

00:03:51.330 --> 00:03:54.580
Why don't we just wait for the video to finish first?

00:03:54.580 --> 00:03:57.210
There's a rumor about the
campgrounds you're staying at,

00:03:57.210 --> 00:04:02.300
saying that a cursed monster lurks there.

00:04:02.900 --> 00:04:05.470
A cursed monster?

00:04:05.470 --> 00:04:10.280
It might have a connection to cursed tools.

00:04:10.280 --> 00:04:12.480
I'd like you to investigate this.

00:04:12.480 --> 00:04:14.980
It's another treasure hunt for a tool.

00:04:14.980 --> 00:04:18.900
I wish he would give up this hobby of his.

00:04:18.900 --> 00:04:23.860
There's supposed to be a small shrine in a cave nearby.

00:04:25.610 --> 00:04:28.120
This is getting more and more dubious.

00:04:28.120 --> 00:04:33.040
It's probably a monster's den.

00:04:33.040 --> 00:04:36.620
If it's cursed equipment, there's no
telling what might happen.

00:04:36.620 --> 00:04:39.130
So take caution.

00:04:40.360 --> 00:04:42.630
If the monster really does exist, I'd like to see it for myself.

00:04:42.630 --> 00:04:50.160
To be honest, this is a low-priority mission in my opinion.

00:04:50.160 --> 00:04:53.060
Oh, how rare. We share the same opinion.

00:04:53.060 --> 00:04:57.770
If that is the case, then we won't be conducting the field trip here.

00:04:57.770 --> 00:04:59.520
I guess not.

00:04:59.520 --> 00:05:03.530
Therefore, you will treat this as an extra mission.

00:05:03.530 --> 00:05:08.940
You can just tell him that you
investigated, but nothing turned up.

00:05:08.940 --> 00:05:11.800
Well, I won't complain if it's just extra.

00:05:11.800 --> 00:05:13.950
I'm too busy.

00:05:14.690 --> 00:05:17.090
"I'll do it when I have the time."

00:05:17.090 --> 00:05:19.300
That's all I need to say, right?

00:05:19.300 --> 00:05:21.900
Yes, that is fine.

00:05:23.170 --> 00:05:24.380
That's our cue.

00:05:24.380 --> 00:05:25.550
Let's go!

00:05:25.550 --> 00:05:27.390
See you later, Zenon-san.

00:05:29.440 --> 00:05:32.450
Well then, I'm counting on you.

00:05:34.640 --> 00:05:36.140
What went wrong?

00:05:36.140 --> 00:05:39.650
I followed all the instructions...

00:05:40.840 --> 00:05:42.400
But I guess I'll have to re-do it.

00:05:42.400 --> 00:05:43.530
How's this?

00:05:43.530 --> 00:05:44.570
And this?

00:05:44.570 --> 00:05:46.040
And this!

00:05:50.780 --> 00:05:52.850
What did I do wrong this time!

00:05:52.850 --> 00:05:55.830
Are you two sure she's the one
who should be setting up the tent?

00:05:55.830 --> 00:06:01.210
She said she'd have it ready in a flash.

00:06:01.210 --> 00:06:03.900
Well, at least she's eager.

00:06:03.900 --> 00:06:06.670
Did I miss anybody?

00:06:04.840 --> 00:06:08.800
Speaking of eagerness, she's looks like she's getting into it.

00:06:09.280 --> 00:06:11.390
I have one tent left-

00:06:11.770 --> 00:06:12.640
Huh?

00:06:23.660 --> 00:06:26.510
W-What just happened?

00:06:26.510 --> 00:06:29.360
You stupid excuse for a tent!

00:06:31.960 --> 00:06:33.250
How's the tent going?

00:06:34.340 --> 00:06:36.280
Just fine!

00:06:36.280 --> 00:06:37.940
It'll be ready soon.

00:06:38.480 --> 00:06:40.070
It does look artistic from certain angles.

00:06:40.070 --> 00:06:42.540
Yes, yes, that's it!

00:06:42.540 --> 00:06:45.830
You'll get your free time when you finish,

00:06:45.830 --> 00:06:46.800
so keep at it!

00:06:46.800 --> 00:06:49.360
Piece of cake!

00:06:49.360 --> 00:06:50.740
I've got this covered.

00:07:05.600 --> 00:07:08.070
This is so refreshing!

00:07:08.570 --> 00:07:10.300
Let's swim!

00:07:10.300 --> 00:07:12.490
We didn't bring any swimsuits.

00:07:12.490 --> 00:07:14.080
Don't be silly!

00:07:14.080 --> 00:07:15.330
Why, you!

00:07:15.330 --> 00:07:17.240
No one calls me silly!

00:07:17.970 --> 00:07:19.820
What are you doing?!

00:07:19.820 --> 00:07:20.160
Take this!

00:07:20.830 --> 00:07:21.800
Take this!

00:07:23.150 --> 00:07:24.000
And this!

00:07:24.370 --> 00:07:24.750
Take this!

00:07:25.860 --> 00:07:26.710
How foolish.

00:07:27.400 --> 00:07:28.460
Hey.

00:07:28.460 --> 00:07:30.670
Stop that.

00:07:32.680 --> 00:07:34.470
Take this!

00:07:36.110 --> 00:07:38.050
I warned you, didn't I?

00:07:38.250 --> 00:07:40.360
That happened because you were playing in the river.

00:07:40.580 --> 00:07:43.040
I can't believe I slipped.

00:07:46.860 --> 00:07:48.190
Haruaki-kun!

00:07:48.190 --> 00:07:50.650
Yachi, what were you looking at?

00:07:53.120 --> 00:07:54.030
An opening!

00:07:58.490 --> 00:07:59.950
Now that's what I call divine retribution!

00:07:59.950 --> 00:08:04.260
Jeez, what did you do that for?

00:08:04.260 --> 00:08:07.270
Hey wait, where's your bra?

00:08:07.470 --> 00:08:09.040
I don't usually wear one.

00:08:09.340 --> 00:08:13.340
I feel constricted when I wear one. I can't bring myself to like them.

00:08:13.340 --> 00:08:15.270
That's not the problem!

00:08:15.270 --> 00:08:18.410
We're playing outdoors today anyways.

00:08:18.410 --> 00:08:20.980
It's important to feel as free as possible.

00:08:20.980 --> 00:08:23.730
<i>That's what an exhibitionist would say.<i></i></i>

00:08:23.730 --> 00:08:27.480
Oh, you kids seem to be having fun.

00:08:27.480 --> 00:08:30.100
Hey, shouldn't you be working?

00:08:30.100 --> 00:08:31.860
Oh, we're still working!

00:08:43.200 --> 00:08:44.080
What?

00:08:44.080 --> 00:08:46.830
When did Kuroe-chan get there?

00:08:48.300 --> 00:08:50.460
It's a substitution technique.

00:08:50.460 --> 00:08:53.350
You're not the one who's supposed to say that!

00:08:56.580 --> 00:08:58.300
Am I sexy?

00:08:59.100 --> 00:09:00.310
You're doing it again.

00:09:03.820 --> 00:09:07.310
Can't you look at anything other than a girl's chest?

00:09:13.010 --> 00:09:14.820
I'm hungry.

00:09:17.860 --> 00:09:20.120
Okay, let's get to work!

00:09:20.120 --> 00:09:22.840
I'm so glad that we're in the same group!

00:09:22.840 --> 00:09:26.120
Yeah, yeah, we're counting on you!

00:09:26.120 --> 00:09:31.090
If I cook everything myself, you won't learn anything.

00:09:31.090 --> 00:09:32.130
What?!

00:09:33.470 --> 00:09:36.750
Making curry is simple, so even you two could handle it.

00:09:36.750 --> 00:09:38.010
Eh?!

00:09:39.010 --> 00:09:43.530
It's about time you learned how to cook dishes with potatoes.

00:09:43.530 --> 00:09:46.360
You won't learn anything if he cooks by himself.

00:09:46.360 --> 00:09:47.640
Not you too, Kirika-chan!

00:09:47.640 --> 00:09:53.150
Since this is a special occasion, I'll let Haruaki eat my cooking.

00:09:53.150 --> 00:09:55.830
You can thank me after you've tasted it.

00:09:55.830 --> 00:09:57.640
Oh, you look enthusiastic.

00:09:57.640 --> 00:09:58.660
I'm looking forward to it.

00:09:58.660 --> 00:10:00.510
Leave it to me!

00:10:00.510 --> 00:10:02.960
Kana, can you teach me what I need to know?

00:10:02.960 --> 00:10:04.170
Of course.

00:10:04.170 --> 00:10:05.500
Let's give it our best, Fear-chan!

00:10:05.500 --> 00:10:09.080
Oh, you traitor!

00:10:10.700 --> 00:10:12.450
No fair! No fair!

00:10:11.270 --> 00:10:14.170
Well then, I'm in charge of washing the rice.

00:10:18.620 --> 00:10:21.390
Are they going to be okay?

00:10:24.430 --> 00:10:27.940
H-How'd they come up with this?

00:10:27.940 --> 00:10:29.440
Well,

00:10:31.100 --> 00:10:32.310
it just happened.

00:10:32.310 --> 00:10:34.500
Whatever, let's eat!

00:10:35.090 --> 00:10:37.690
Yeah, we should eat it before it gets cold.

00:10:37.690 --> 00:10:40.300
Thank you for the food!

00:10:43.700 --> 00:10:45.400
This is delicious!

00:10:45.400 --> 00:10:46.770
You fool!

00:10:46.770 --> 00:10:50.650
Of course it's delicious! Konoha-san helped make it!

00:10:50.650 --> 00:10:53.040
This is the best curry I've ever had, Konoha-san!

00:10:53.040 --> 00:10:55.070
Thank you very much!

00:10:55.370 --> 00:10:57.860
How is it, Haruaki-kun?

00:10:57.860 --> 00:11:00.820
While I can't say it looks that appetizing,

00:11:00.820 --> 00:11:03.470
it is tasty, almost like steak curry.

00:11:03.470 --> 00:11:05.140
I agree.

00:11:05.140 --> 00:11:06.680
It's quite delicious.

00:11:06.680 --> 00:11:09.690
It has a lot of calories, though.

00:11:09.690 --> 00:11:13.940
But since we're on a trip, I'm just going to call in the "OK" rule and say it's okay.

00:11:15.030 --> 00:11:18.620
Yet again, Cow Tits goes and makes another beef dish.

00:11:19.840 --> 00:11:23.130
I guess you're doomed to that destiny.

00:11:28.880 --> 00:11:29.870
I'm tired.

00:11:30.530 --> 00:11:32.370
I wish this thing would go faster.

00:11:35.270 --> 00:11:39.580
Now, why don't we get started on
the board chairman's request.

00:11:39.580 --> 00:11:40.870
Oh yeah.

00:11:40.870 --> 00:11:44.840
Yup, let's just think of this as an after-dinner stroll.

00:11:44.840 --> 00:11:46.140
Are you going for a walk?

00:11:47.470 --> 00:11:49.350
May I tag along?

00:11:50.350 --> 00:11:52.030
Sure, I don't mind, Class Rep.

00:11:52.230 --> 00:11:55.270
Ninety percent of this is going to be a stroll, but ten percent will be an investigation.

00:11:55.270 --> 00:11:58.500
You may come along only if that's all right with you.

00:11:58.500 --> 00:11:59.650
Investigation?

00:11:59.650 --> 00:12:04.130
The truth is that the board chairman gave us another strange request.

00:12:07.660 --> 00:12:11.910
It's always nice to take a stroll
through the outdoors after a meal.

00:12:11.910 --> 00:12:15.150
It would've been even better if Kuroe and Sovereignty could have tagged along.

00:12:15.150 --> 00:12:17.070
Speaking of which, where did they run off to?

00:12:17.070 --> 00:12:18.990
I can't seem to find them.

00:12:18.990 --> 00:12:21.670
Well, they <i>are</i> here to work. They probably had something to do.

00:12:21.670 --> 00:12:25.300
Is there really a monster here?

00:12:25.300 --> 00:12:27.480
I don't think there is one.

00:12:27.480 --> 00:12:28.820
What a stupid story.

00:12:28.820 --> 00:12:29.810
I know, right?

00:12:29.810 --> 00:12:31.840
No!

00:12:31.840 --> 00:12:32.640
What was that?!

00:12:32.640 --> 00:12:33.810
It came from that direction!

00:12:39.280 --> 00:12:41.340
T-This is...

00:12:41.990 --> 00:12:45.950
The fanatic is somewhere 

00:12:41.990 --> 00:12:45.990
The Outdoor School Confusion!

00:12:50.350 --> 00:12:51.700
This is odd.

00:12:51.700 --> 00:12:53.050
What is?

00:12:53.050 --> 00:12:56.740
Nobody was absent during roll call.

00:12:56.740 --> 00:12:59.260
Nobody looked really spooked either.

00:13:00.210 --> 00:13:04.220
Then what was that scream we heard earlier?

00:13:04.220 --> 00:13:08.620
Maybe it was a monster's shriek.

00:13:08.620 --> 00:13:09.900
What?

00:13:09.900 --> 00:13:15.880
If people wander too close, it'll snap their heads right off!

00:13:17.860 --> 00:13:20.070
Stop trying to scare us!

00:13:20.070 --> 00:13:22.160
I'm coming in.

00:13:22.160 --> 00:13:24.530
Oh, it's a drum bath?

00:13:25.320 --> 00:13:27.530
This is nostalgic.

00:13:30.500 --> 00:13:32.100
Welcome!

00:13:32.100 --> 00:13:33.490
Would you like to warm up first?

00:13:33.490 --> 00:13:35.930
Or would you rather wash your body first?

00:13:35.930 --> 00:13:37.640
I'll scrub your back.

00:13:37.640 --> 00:13:39.420
I'd like to wash up first.

00:13:39.420 --> 00:13:41.310
Leave it to me!

00:13:48.120 --> 00:13:49.580
Look over there, Kuroe!

00:13:49.580 --> 00:13:52.680
That is the true form of the
Tiny Breasts Alliance's arch-enemy.

00:13:52.680 --> 00:13:56.870
Yes, it is indeed a frightening existence.

00:13:56.870 --> 00:14:01.690
Can't you pretend that your hands slipped and throw some burning coals her way?

00:14:02.140 --> 00:14:04.910
Maybe one will burn a hole and those lumps will deflate.

00:14:04.910 --> 00:14:06.570
Are you calling my breasts <i>balloons</i>?

00:14:06.570 --> 00:14:07.830
Of course.

00:14:07.830 --> 00:14:10.080
Purge the extra gas!

00:14:10.080 --> 00:14:12.180
Shrink!

00:14:12.180 --> 00:14:14.100
Shrink!

00:14:15.230 --> 00:14:17.330
These girls...

00:14:20.750 --> 00:14:23.340
Ficchi, how is the temperature?

00:14:23.340 --> 00:14:25.840
Oh, it's just right.

00:14:28.970 --> 00:14:32.100
But, that Zenon...

00:14:32.100 --> 00:14:36.100
"I apologize, but due to overwhelming numbers,

00:14:36.100 --> 00:14:41.350
I ask that everyone have some patience and
refrain from overcrowding the shower facilities.

00:14:42.010 --> 00:14:45.900
So I wondered what she meant by that.

00:14:45.900 --> 00:14:50.420
Still, she gave us these baths to make up for it.

00:14:50.420 --> 00:14:53.160
I think it's better this way.

00:14:53.850 --> 00:14:55.340
I agree.

00:14:55.340 --> 00:14:57.830
We can submerge ourselves all the way up to our shoulders in the hot water.

00:14:57.830 --> 00:15:04.500
Besides, Ueno-san wouldn't do too well in a shower with a bunch of people.

00:15:04.500 --> 00:15:07.100
Oh, you're here, Kirika.

00:15:07.100 --> 00:15:08.450
The water's great!

00:15:08.450 --> 00:15:09.010
Hurry and get in!

00:15:10.520 --> 00:15:12.010
This is foolish.

00:15:12.010 --> 00:15:14.650
There's no one here except us.

00:15:14.650 --> 00:15:16.010
You don't need to worry.

00:15:17.230 --> 00:15:19.180
She's right, Ueno-san.

00:15:21.900 --> 00:15:25.230
Jeez, stop worrying about me!

00:15:25.230 --> 00:15:26.780
I don't need help either.

00:15:27.420 --> 00:15:28.480
Is that so?

00:15:28.480 --> 00:15:29.650
That's unfortunate.

00:15:37.190 --> 00:15:40.450
I guess it's okay if you only pull them off a little, isn't it?

00:15:40.450 --> 00:15:42.620
It must be quite a hassle.

00:15:42.620 --> 00:15:45.530
This makes me a little nervous.

00:15:45.530 --> 00:15:49.710
Mhm, it's awakening the fetishist inside me.

00:15:50.670 --> 00:15:53.030
Okay, I just <i>have </i>to help you!

00:15:53.030 --> 00:15:54.650
I'll scrub your back!

00:15:54.650 --> 00:15:56.560
Sovereignty-kun?

00:15:56.560 --> 00:16:00.560
You know, I don't think you look weird at all.

00:16:00.560 --> 00:16:05.010
You don't have to feel embarrassed or inferior.

00:16:05.010 --> 00:16:06.680
I can assure you that.

00:16:06.680 --> 00:16:08.570
That's why I want to help you wash your back.

00:16:08.570 --> 00:16:10.790
Yup, she's right.

00:16:10.790 --> 00:16:13.320
Smooth, Sovereignty.

00:16:21.470 --> 00:16:23.460
Sorry!

00:16:25.500 --> 00:16:26.500
An intruder?!

00:16:31.600 --> 00:16:34.260
Shiraho-san?

00:16:40.270 --> 00:16:42.390
Even if it's Shiraho-kun...

00:16:42.390 --> 00:16:45.760
I suppose a girl as infamously clumsy as her...

00:16:45.760 --> 00:16:48.770
wouldn't be able to use the substitution technique.

00:16:48.770 --> 00:16:51.150
Why do you sound disappointed?

00:16:51.150 --> 00:16:55.660
Shiraho's movements have seemed more and more superhuman lately.

00:16:58.120 --> 00:17:02.140
By the way, what do you think happened this evening?

00:17:02.140 --> 00:17:04.150
Frankly, I don't have a clue.

00:17:04.150 --> 00:17:06.700
We never did find any victims.

00:17:07.000 --> 00:17:11.140
However, something odd did happen.

00:17:11.440 --> 00:17:14.660
I can feel an eerie aura as well.

00:17:14.760 --> 00:17:15.970
You're right.

00:17:16.270 --> 00:17:18.430
I hope it's only our imagination.

00:17:18.730 --> 00:17:22.030
In that case, better safe than sorry.

00:17:22.330 --> 00:17:24.010
Is that where this conversation is going?

00:17:24.310 --> 00:17:25.690
You got that right.

00:17:25.990 --> 00:17:29.690
After all, if we wait for something to happen first, it'll already be too late.

00:17:42.760 --> 00:17:45.090
The rain is getting worse.

00:17:45.290 --> 00:17:48.460
Why don't we pass the time talking?

00:17:48.660 --> 00:17:52.440
On the off-chance that the monster did exist,

00:17:52.640 --> 00:17:54.920
what do you think it would look like?

00:17:55.120 --> 00:17:57.640
Hm... Its appearance...

00:17:58.470 --> 00:18:02.750
What was left at the crime scene was some sort of oozy slime.

00:18:02.750 --> 00:18:06.940
The deep holes in the ground, the long gashes in the trees.

00:18:06.940 --> 00:18:09.440
Based on these facts, my conclusion is...

00:18:11.600 --> 00:18:14.620
...that it was something terrifying.

00:18:14.620 --> 00:18:19.580
My body wants to reject any further thoughts on this subject.

00:18:19.580 --> 00:18:22.170
Oh my.  I don't get what you mean.

00:18:22.170 --> 00:18:23.740
Do you mean to say you're scared?

00:18:23.740 --> 00:18:26.530
What the... I'll curse you!

00:18:26.530 --> 00:18:28.210
I'm not scared.

00:18:28.830 --> 00:18:29.820
Just now...

00:18:56.490 --> 00:18:58.110
This is...

00:19:00.280 --> 00:19:02.030
Yachi

00:19:02.330 --> 00:19:04.130
Haruaki...

00:19:08.010 --> 00:19:10.550
Zenon-san! Zenon-san!

00:19:11.970 --> 00:19:13.290
Did something happen?

00:19:13.290 --> 00:19:17.970
There's supposed to be a suspicious cave with a small shrine around here, right?

00:19:18.550 --> 00:19:19.300
Yes.

00:19:20.930 --> 00:19:22.180
This is the place, isn't it?

00:19:22.720 --> 00:19:25.920
This place is fit to be the nest of a monster.

00:19:27.770 --> 00:19:29.480
Are you okay, Fear-kun?

00:19:29.480 --> 00:19:32.060
If it scares you that badly, then you can wait here.

00:19:32.730 --> 00:19:33.690
Why you!

00:19:39.400 --> 00:19:40.280
Yachi

00:19:52.040 --> 00:19:53.630
I...

00:19:53.630 --> 00:19:55.380
I...

00:19:55.770 --> 00:20:00.470
Haruaki!

00:20:00.890 --> 00:20:02.960
I don't care anymore!

00:20:03.720 --> 00:20:05.370
Ah, jeez!

00:20:06.440 --> 00:20:07.560
How foolish.

00:20:10.440 --> 00:20:12.500
Hey, look out!

00:20:16.710 --> 00:20:18.620
That's why I warned you.

00:20:19.690 --> 00:20:20.930
What are you doing?!

00:20:20.930 --> 00:20:21.600
I'll curse you!

00:20:21.600 --> 00:20:23.600
I only did it because you didn't
watch where you were going!

00:20:27.200 --> 00:20:29.450
But, this hole...

00:20:29.450 --> 00:20:30.450
Konoha-kun!

00:20:47.880 --> 00:20:49.420
This feeling...

00:20:51.480 --> 00:20:53.400
I won't be defeated!

00:20:57.690 --> 00:20:59.200
Kurokawa Karen!

00:21:10.540 --> 00:21:12.080
Damn you, monster!

00:21:12.080 --> 00:21:16.040
You would go so far as to set up pitfalls and falling log traps!

00:21:18.190 --> 00:21:19.380
It's sticky thread!

00:21:22.380 --> 00:21:24.220
Haruaki! Haruaki!

00:21:24.220 --> 00:21:26.600
If we stick around too long, we might get gobbled up!

00:21:26.600 --> 00:21:28.800
Haruaki!

00:21:42.240 --> 00:21:44.110
I-It won't budge.

00:21:45.000 --> 00:21:46.910
How did I end up here?

00:21:49.410 --> 00:21:52.540
No matter how much I try, I can't remember what happened.

00:21:53.520 --> 00:21:56.540
Will someone please help me?!

00:21:57.920 --> 00:22:01.800
<i>Konoha</i> might come to rescue me,
but Fear, on the other hand...

00:22:04.320 --> 00:22:06.280
Yeah, she's not coming.

00:22:12.840 --> 00:22:13.680
Fear!

00:22:13.680 --> 00:22:15.650
Ha... Haruaki!

00:22:16.010 --> 00:22:17.060
You're safe?

00:22:17.060 --> 00:22:18.350
You're okay, right?

00:22:21.700 --> 00:22:24.090
Are you okay, Haruaki-kun?

00:22:24.390 --> 00:22:25.670
Are you all right, Yachi?

00:22:26.070 --> 00:22:28.860
Konoha... and you too, Class Rep?

00:22:28.860 --> 00:22:31.370
Let me cut those off first.

00:22:33.120 --> 00:22:34.660
Thank you!

00:22:34.660 --> 00:22:36.120
You're welcome.

00:22:37.630 --> 00:22:38.980
Thank goodness.

00:22:38.980 --> 00:22:40.620
Are you okay, Fear?

00:22:40.620 --> 00:22:42.380
I'm fine.

00:22:42.380 --> 00:22:45.760
I'm totally fine.

00:22:45.760 --> 00:22:47.590
I'm not scared, not one bit!

00:22:47.590 --> 00:22:49.120
If you say so.

00:22:51.160 --> 00:22:52.760
What is this place?

00:22:52.760 --> 00:22:54.930
This is...

00:22:54.930 --> 00:22:56.720
The "suspicious cave" we've been talking about.

00:22:56.720 --> 00:22:59.270
As I thought, this is the origin of all the malice.

00:22:59.270 --> 00:23:03.600
I believe the evil monster was born from this small shrine.

00:23:06.600 --> 00:23:08.900
You don't need to do anything.

00:23:08.900 --> 00:23:10.280
What are you saying, Milk Bags?!

00:23:11.040 --> 00:23:14.530
This small shrine is too young to be a cursed item.

00:23:15.260 --> 00:23:18.040
A scream with no screamer.

00:23:18.040 --> 00:23:20.370
The feeling I got when I cut the threads.

00:23:21.540 --> 00:23:22.790
Our culprit is over there!

00:23:26.350 --> 00:23:31.380
Furthermore, there was a mat at the bottom of the pit,

00:23:31.380 --> 00:23:33.890
and the trees were paper mache.

00:23:34.540 --> 00:23:36.720
Wow, you two are foolish.

00:23:37.950 --> 00:23:39.220
Well then...

00:23:39.220 --> 00:23:41.800
W-We apologize!

00:23:41.800 --> 00:23:46.770
If you want me to accept your apology, then tell me how you did it!

00:23:46.770 --> 00:23:50.590
Well, how should we put it?

00:23:50.590 --> 00:23:53.660
Uh, it was something like this...

00:23:54.600 --> 00:23:56.660
Yeah, and this...

00:23:58.410 --> 00:23:59.790
Anything else?

00:24:00.510 --> 00:24:02.750
It was something like this...

00:24:02.750 --> 00:24:07.330
W-What the heck?

00:24:12.970 --> 00:24:15.970
The chairman told us to show you this after you catch us.

00:24:15.970 --> 00:24:19.120
Now, I'll let you in on a secret.

00:24:19.120 --> 00:24:22.930
I was the one pulling the strings!

00:24:26.920 --> 00:24:30.320
Everything was done because I ordered it!

00:24:30.320 --> 00:24:33.190
I arranged your once-in-a-lifetime school camping trip,

00:24:33.190 --> 00:24:40.660
so that you could make some fond memories.

00:24:42.840 --> 00:24:48.860
Also, I wanted Fear-kun to overcome her weakness.

00:24:50.220 --> 00:24:51.330
What do you think?

00:24:51.330 --> 00:24:52.940
Was it thrilling?

00:24:52.940 --> 00:24:55.100
Did your bonds grow stronger?

00:24:55.100 --> 00:24:57.660
Did you overcome your weakness?

00:24:58.170 --> 00:24:59.780
I don't need any thanks.

00:25:03.020 --> 00:25:06.350
P.S. This player was pretty cheap.

00:25:06.350 --> 00:25:07.540
No need to hold back.

00:25:07.540 --> 00:25:08.360
Have at it.

00:25:11.250 --> 00:25:15.200
W-What the hell was that all about?!

00:25:18.930 --> 00:25:21.740
For crying out loud, he's such a troublemaker sometimes!

00:25:21.740 --> 00:25:25.250
He won't be getting any thanks from me right now. Instead, I'll let him have it when I get back.

00:25:25.250 --> 00:25:29.250
Still, Fear, I'm kind of happy.

00:25:29.250 --> 00:25:33.720
You came to rescue me even though you were scared of the spider monster.

00:25:34.660 --> 00:25:35.630
Thank you!

00:25:36.300 --> 00:25:38.890
Ah, it was nothing.

00:25:38.890 --> 00:25:41.620
Actually, I didn't...

00:25:45.560 --> 00:25:48.540
N-No, you're wrong.

00:25:48.540 --> 00:25:49.440
Huh?

00:25:49.440 --> 00:25:50.600
You're wrong!

00:25:50.600 --> 00:25:55.240
First of all, I'm not scared of spiders.

00:25:55.240 --> 00:25:56.910
I'll curse you!

00:25:56.910 --> 00:25:57.760
Is that so?

00:25:57.760 --> 00:25:58.870
Yes, I will.

00:25:58.870 --> 00:25:59.870
Really?

00:25:59.870 --> 00:26:00.710
You're persistent.

00:26:00.710 --> 00:26:02.290
I meant what I said!

00:26:02.290 --> 00:26:05.880
Then, Fear-san, could you turn around for me?

00:26:10.460 --> 00:26:13.940
No!

00:26:19.270 --> 00:26:25.140
kisetsu wo tsugeru iro wo

00:26:19.270 --> 00:26:25.140
The flowers once again bloom

00:26:26.150 --> 00:26:32.020
matotte mata hana ga saku

00:26:26.150 --> 00:26:32.020
In the season's colors

00:26:32.820 --> 00:26:38.280
anna fuu ni anata ni yorisoi

00:26:32.820 --> 00:26:38.280
If I could snuggle next to you

00:26:38.580 --> 00:26:41.990
sukoshizutsu shiawase ni

00:26:38.580 --> 00:26:41.990
And feel my happiness slowly grow

00:26:42.040 --> 00:26:46.910
naretara ii na

00:26:42.040 --> 00:26:46.910
It'd be so nice

00:26:49.340 --> 00:26:55.840
motto motto suki ni natte ii desuka

00:26:49.340 --> 00:26:55.840
Is it okay if I fall deeper and deeper for you?

00:26:56.010 --> 00:26:59.170
kokoro ni wa itsudatte

00:26:56.010 --> 00:26:59.170
You're always the one

00:26:59.390 --> 00:27:02.720
anata ga iru

00:26:59.390 --> 00:27:02.720
Who's in my heart

00:27:03.020 --> 00:27:06.010
fureau kimochi

00:27:03.020 --> 00:27:06.010
And when our hearts meet

00:27:06.270 --> 00:27:09.480
mirai wo kaete

00:27:06.270 --> 00:27:09.480
The future changes

00:27:09.530 --> 00:27:15.900
kodoku ga ai wo sodateru imi mo

00:27:09.530 --> 00:27:15.900
I can believe that loneliness fosters love

00:27:16.280 --> 00:27:22.490
futari nara futari nara shinjite yukeru

00:27:16.280 --> 00:27:22.490
If you and I, you and I, are together

00:27:22.540 --> 00:27:26.080
kanarazu

00:27:22.540 --> 00:27:26.080
I'm sure

00:27:45.600 --> 00:27:48.800
Oh, I'm glad that you were able to complete your task safely.

00:27:50.390 --> 00:27:53.480
I still feel sorry for tricking you, though.

00:27:53.480 --> 00:27:57.770
Humph! I'm going to direct all my
complaints to the board chairman!

00:27:57.770 --> 00:28:00.990
Kuroe's and my tent is here.

00:28:03.030 --> 00:28:04.330
What's wrong?

00:28:04.330 --> 00:28:06.370
W-What should I do?

00:28:06.370 --> 00:28:10.370
I think I hear some strange noises coming from inside.

00:28:10.370 --> 00:28:14.520
M-Maybe a real monster is in there.

00:28:23.020 --> 00:28:25.190
Where have you gone?

00:28:25.190 --> 00:28:27.920
Sovereignty won't understand my feelings!

00:28:27.920 --> 00:28:30.140
I've come here to charge my love meter!

00:28:30.140 --> 00:28:33.900
This odor, Sovereignty's scent!

00:28:33.900 --> 00:28:35.520
I can't control myself!

00:28:37.140 --> 00:28:38.610
Sovereignty!

00:28:59.520 --> 00:29:01.460
How much did you see?

00:29:01.460 --> 00:29:03.700
Crap! I don't know what's going on!

00:29:03.700 --> 00:29:05.590
Just run!

00:29:07.500 --> 00:29:10.510
Shiraho, calm down!

00:29:10.510 --> 00:29:11.900
Please!

00:29:13.400 --> 00:29:16.880
Your scent is so comforting. I feel like my mom is hugging me!

00:29:16.880 --> 00:29:18.240
Now's not the time!

00:29:18.240 --> 00:29:19.610
How stupid can this get?

00:29:20.160 --> 00:29:24.260
Forget <i>everything </i>you just saw!
